{"toolCallId":"call_0b9491256fe2448f96cf3e56b2cea7d5","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"67:+-- recommend-level.sh           # Recommend documentation level from task signals\n120:| `template-phrase-census.mjs` | Read-only census of the trigger phrases that template blocks leave in the 18 document kinds, split into live and archived tracks, with a count of malformed frontmatter. `--root <dir>` picks the tree, `specs` by default, and `--json` prints the report as JSON. |\n---\n     383 .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/README.md\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"b52d2a","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
