{"toolCallId":"call_16bf7851daae4e0c88caf1428c6b5da3","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"specFolder\": \"zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\",\n  \"description\": \"Add a quiet flag to recommend-level.sh\",\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"quiet\",\n    \"flag\",\n    \"recommend-level\"\n  ],\n  \"lastUpdated\": \"2026-10-26T05:14:28.007Z\",\n  \"specId\": \"001\",\n  \"folderSlug\": \"recommend-level-quiet-flag\",\n  \"parentChain\": [\n    \"zz-bench-authoring\"\n  ],\n  \"memorySequence\": 0,\n  \"memoryNameHistory\": [],\n  \"level\": \"3\"\n}---\n11:# Description: Validates description.json identity, description, and level fields.\n17:    local description_file=\"$folder/description.json\"\n25:    if [[ ! -f \"$description_file\" ]]; then\n27:        RULE_MESSAGE=\"description.json missing; shape validation skipped\"\n33:    shape_output=$(node - \"$description_file\" <<'EOF' 2>&1\n52:if (!hasString(data, \"description\")) {\n53:  errors.push(\"description must be a non-empty string\");\n75:        RULE_MESSAGE=\"description.json has ${#errors[@]} shape error(s)\"\n77:        RULE_REMEDIATION=\"Refresh description.json through the canonical generation flow, or repair identity, description, and level fields.\"\n92:    recorded=\"$(node -e 'const d=require(process.argv[1]);process.stdout.write(d.level==null?\"\":String(d.level))' \"$(cd \"$folder\" && pwd)/description.json\" 2>/dev/null || true)\"\n96:        RULE_MESSAGE=\"description.json level ${recorded} disagrees with the level the packet declares (${declared})\"\n97:        RULE_DETAILS=(\"declared in $doc as SPECKIT_LEVEL: ${declared}\" \"recorded in description.json as ${recorded}\")\n103:    RULE_MESSAGE=\"description.json shape validation passed\"\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"69aa70","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
