VALUE_HERE: Main features working] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Date/Phase] |\n    - plan.md:248: | M3 | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Release Ready] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: All tests pass] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Date/Phase] |\n    - plan.md:256: ### ADR-001: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Decision Title]\n    - plan.md:258: **Status**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Proposed/Accepted/Deprecated]\n    - plan.md:260: **Context**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What problem we're solving]\n    - plan.md:262: **Decision**: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What we decided]\n    - plan.md:265: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Positive outcome 1]\n    - plan.md:266: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Negative outcome + mitigation]\n    - plan.md:269: - [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Option B]: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Why rejected]\n    - tasks.md:47: - [ ] T004 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Implement core feature 1]\n    - tasks.md:48: - [ ] T005 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Implement core feature 2]\n    - tasks.md:49: - [ ] T006 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Implement core feature 3]\n    - tasks.md:50: - [ ] T007 [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Add error handling]\n    - tasks.md:267: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Name] | Technical Lead | [ ] Approved | |\n    - tasks.md:268: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Name] | Product Owner | [ ] Approved | |\n    - tasks.md:269: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Name] | QA Lead | [ ] Approved | |\n    - implementation-summary.md:50: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Opening hook: 2-3 sentences on what changed and why it matters. Lead with impact.]\n    - implementation-summary.md:61: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: path] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Created/Modified/Deleted] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What this change accomplishe\n    - implementation-summary.md:70: [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: How was this tested, verified and shipped? What was the rollout approach?]\n    - implementation-summary.md:81: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: What was decided] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Active-voice rationale with specific reasoning] |\n    - implementation-summary.md:92: | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Validation, lint, tests, manual check] | [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: PASS/FAIL with specifics] |\n    - implementation-summary.md:101: 1. **[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Limitation]** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Specific detail with workaround if one exists.]\n    - acceptance-criteria.md:19: session_id: \"[YOUR_VALUE_HERE: SESSION-ID]\"\n    - acceptance-criteria.md:40: **Packet:** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: PACKET-ID]\n    - acceptance-criteria.md:42: **Status:** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Draft/In Progress/Complete]\n    - acceptance-criteria.md:56: | AC-001 | REQ-001 | Given [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: context], When [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: action], Then [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: observable\n    - acceptance-criteria.md:82: **Closeable:** [YOUR_VALUE_HERE: Yes/No]\n+ TEMPLATE_SOURCE: Template source headers present\n+ ANCHORS_VALID: Anchors well formed in 5 file(s)\n+ FRONTMATTER_VALID: Frontmatter continuity basics present\n+ FRONTMATTER_MEMORY_BLOCK: All spec-doc frontmatter memory blocks are structurally valid\n+ SPEC_DOC_SUFFICIENCY: All targeted spec-doc anchors meet the sufficiency baseline\n+ MERGE_LEGALITY: No merge plan supplied; legality check skipped\n+ CROSS_ANCHOR_CONTAMINATION: No routing payload supplied; contamination check skipped\n+ POST_SAVE_FINGERPRINT: No post-save payload supplied; fingerprint check skipped\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_PRESENT: Graph metadata checked\n+ GENERATED_METADATA_INTEGRITY: Generated metadata passed schema, status-enum and path-prefix invariants\n+ GENERATED_METADATA_DRIFT: Generated synopsis fields match the current docs\n+ COMMENT_HYGIENE_MARKER: No ephemeral comment-hygiene markers found\n+ SCAFFOLD_NEVER_TOUCHED: Spec status is 'Draft', not Complete; scaffold markers are allowed\n+ STATUS_CROSS_DOC_CONSISTENCY: status cross-doc check not applicable; one status is missing or unclassified\n    - spec.md Status=Draft classified=planned\n    - implementation-summary.md Status=<missing> classified=unknown\n+ AC_COVERAGE: Acceptance coverage gate not active for this level or lifecycle state\n+ TOC_POLICY: TOC policy passed: no TOC headings in non-research spec documents\n! AI_PROTOCOLS: AI protocol incomplete (0/4 components)\n    - Level 3 should include AI Execution Protocol section\n    - Missing Pre-Task Checklist\n    - Missing Execution Rules table\n    - Missing Status Reporting Format\n    - Missing Blocked Task Protocol\n+ COMPLEXITY_MATCH: Complexity level consistent with content (Level 3; phases=3, tasks=60, stories=2, scenarios=0)\n+ FOLDER_NAMING: Folder name '001-recommend-level-quiet-flag' follows naming convention\n+ FRONTMATTER_VALUES: Frontmatter values are in the shared list\n+ SOURCE_TAGS: No [SOURCE:] path:line citations in research or review artifacts\n+ GREP_CONVENTION: Grep convention: 5 document(s) conform\n+ LEVEL_MATCH: Level consistent across all files (Level 3)\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_CHILD_DRIFT: children_ids matches the on-disk phase children\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_CHILD_IDENTITY: children_ids entries all carry the packet's own identity\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_SHAPE: graph-metadata.json shape validation passed\n+ METADATA_DISK_PATH_CONSISTENCY: metadata paths carry the scaffold marker; the packet is not filed yet\n+ DESCRIPTION_SHAPE: description.json shape validation passed\n+ NORMALIZER_LINT: No local normalizeScope*/getOptionalString declarations found outside allowed files\n+ SPEC_DOC_INTEGRITY: Spec doc references, metadata, and handover targets resolve cleanly\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_ROOT_SPEC_REQUIRED: Canonical-save root-spec check not applicable to this folder\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_SOURCE_DOCS_REQUIRED: Canonical-save source-doc check not applicable to this folder\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_LINEAGE_REQUIRED: save_lineage is present for the refreshed graph metadata\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_PACKET_IDENTITY_NORMALIZED: Packet identity normalization drift detected (soft detector)\n    - identity=scaffold/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n    - identity=zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_DESCRIPTION_GRAPH_FRESHNESS: Description and graph freshness stay within the canonical-save slack window\n+ CONTINUITY_FRESHNESS: Continuity freshness skipped: SPECKIT_COMPLETION_FRESHNESS is not enabled\n    - code:not_opted_in\n+ LINKS_VALID: All wikilinks under the system-spec-kit skill resolve\n\nSummary: Errors: 0  Warnings: 2\n\nRESULT: PASSED\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"bbb551","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
