{"toolCallId":"call_fc59694baf6e46dd9bf5e4ddab3fab48","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"would repair specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n    packet pointer -> zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n    re-derive graph metadata\n\ninspected=1 repairable=1 failed=0\n\nNot repairable here — these record work someone did, and only they can write them:\n      1  AI_PROTOCOLS\n      1  PLACEHOLDER_FILLED\n\nTo apply these repairs:\n  node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/repair-derived.cjs --folder specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag --apply\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w1eb206b128/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"fc5b2c","exit_code":1,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
